%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI have a favor to ask of you.\d%K%P
「我有个请求」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou... from me...?\d%K%P
「…你向？\n我么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes. From you, Asami.\d%K%P
「我，向麻实你」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Asami's eyes wavered slightly.%K%P
麻实的眼神，微微地，动摇了些许。%K%P
Not only did I show up in her life out of nowhere, I\nstarted asking for favors -- she must have felt like she\naccidentally opened a box full of curses and bad luck.%K%P
明明想也没想过会和我以这样的方式再次相遇，\n就更别提能想到我会这样对她提出请求了，\n这真的是跟不小心掀开了泔水桶一个感觉。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI want you to give her more time.\d%K%P
「她的情况，希望你能再观察一小段时间」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I see.\d%K%P
「…这么回事啊」%K%P
She seemed more surprised by the fact that I was asking\nfor her help, than by the actual contents of my request.%K%P
一下子被拜托，虽然出乎她的意料，\n但是其中的内容她好像早就料到了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe has permission from the school to deliver newspapers.\nShe's no longer working any other jobs, nor do I plan to\nlet her. Her living expenses can be covered by the rent\nfrom this place.\d%K%P
「配送报纸的兼职已经得到了学校的许可了。\n其他的活儿现在都已经不干了，以后也不会干。\n生活上…用我们收的房租也能对付上」%K%P
It was almost dizzying how many things I ended up having\nAsami buy. I listed them off quickly, in an attempt to\nmask my uncertainty.%K%P
连着说了一大串不靠谱的前提条件，简直都能把我自己弄晕了，\n总而言之是趁着自己还没慌神赶紧一口气说完了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd when it comes to discipline and education beyond\nschool subjects, well, she doesn't really need that, does\nshe? She's already more respectable than I am.\d%K%P
「至于孩子的道德思想教育什么的正课之外的…\n我觉得对那孩子来说已经没有必要了吧？\n…她比我这种人靠谱多了」%K%P
If anything, she should have learned how to be more\negotistical.%K%P
她所欠缺的，\n就只有『孩子该有的的任性』这样的东西了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWithout her, I believe the Terrace House Hinosaka will\nfall apart.\d%K%P
「要是让那孩子离开这里的话，\n我想这『Terrace House阳之坂』恐怕也保持不住如今的面貌了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell... that's definitely true. Though, the way I look at\nit, a single earthquake could achieve that just the same.\d%K%P
「这恐怕…肯定是保不住的吧。\n不过看上去来个大点的地震什么的也得塌就是」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut Mitoko wants to watch over this house and wait for\nher mother here.\d%K%P
「但是美都子她，一直期望着有一天妈妈能回到这里，\n就这样一直守在这里等着呢」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo please, could you turn a blind eye to her actions for\njust a little while longer? I mean, you're her homeroom\nteacher, right?\d%K%P
「所以说拜托了。\n为了美都子的思念，能不能稍微对她网开一面呢？\n…麻实你是她的班主任吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's precisely because of who I am that I have the\nresponsibility to make sure Ms. Hinosaka is leading a safe\nand happy life.\d%K%P
「…正因为我是她的班主任，\n我才有不可逃避的义务确保阳坂同学的身心健康」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I'm... that is, me and the other tenants are taking\ncare of that!\d%K%P
「那方面就由我…\n不，由我们这些住户尽力完成吧」%K%P
Although, if anything, I felt it was rather she who was\nlooking after me.%K%P
不过实际上倒是我们这边总是受着各种各样的照顾就是了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dStill... I never would've expected to see you bow your\nhead to me again.\d%K%P
「话说回来…\n理你事到如今再低头求我什么的…呐」%K%P
In fairness, I'd never expected I'd be bowing my head to\nher myself... Not even in my wildest dreams.%K%P
对我来说，我也从没有想过事到如今还会\n再低下头来求你什么的就是了…呐。%K%P
